    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0159",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s08-p159-00982-s001",
      "sentenceText": "There is a popular proverb in Japan, 温故知新.",
      "sentenceSha256": "cd64f1d97143ecfe8baf637ee8e1b684cca44aea80df7b0c2847599588e2f862",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s08-p159-00982-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-099",
      "parentFingerprint": "6cc063b205bb4cd8105e862e549fe409e4cd623fa242318c583115086c673ae9",
      "passageSha256": "770052796c27af4ab2da0f756f04c904c8dcb6cc54b930fd7b67faeda3ac0ce4",
      "pdfPages": [
        159
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0160",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s08-p159-00982-s002",
      "sentenceText": "The first character means “warm,” the second “old,” the third “knowledge,” and the last “new.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "f4f850c0e2b003e3925471617533f0813332327065d282629520175226454908",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s08-p159-00982-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-099",
      "parentFingerprint": "6cc063b205bb4cd8105e862e549fe409e4cd623fa242318c583115086c673ae9",
      "passageSha256": "770052796c27af4ab2da0f756f04c904c8dcb6cc54b930fd7b67faeda3ac0ce4",
      "pdfPages": [
        159
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0161",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s08-p159-00982-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Warm the old, then you will learn something new.",
      "sentenceSha256": "57973003d6432d14ee3279c577eb8cc14003be2864b2e9d9d916a52bcc77c9aa",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s08-p159-00982-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-099",
      "parentFingerprint": "6cc063b205bb4cd8105e862e549fe409e4cd623fa242318c583115086c673ae9",
      "passageSha256": "770052796c27af4ab2da0f756f04c904c8dcb6cc54b930fd7b67faeda3ac0ce4",
      "pdfPages": [
        159
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0162",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s08-p159-01762-s004",
      "sentenceText": "The Beatles, Bob Dylan, Aretha Franklin, Miles Davis, Picasso, Yayoi Kusama, Hilma af Klint, Kara Walker—all have embraced experiment, tried new styles, and evolved over time.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c4c874ef747284f879ae4706121b8bf62f3e49afb614ae4a6d9fceb96992f049",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s08-p159-01762-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-101",
      "parentFingerprint": "d9f6a2206d89ba91d7d84a1875170770a3d31ebbe57c27013e32c9bae5ede136",
      "passageSha256": "6a8ce7bfa206dc5bce56ac2dde526a2ba5b207137bfd8cb0fe0a08c3f78c3d3b",
      "pdfPages": [
        159
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0163",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s08-p159-01762-s005",
      "sentenceText": "You can learn something new from each of these artists by digging deeper and deeper into their work over a long period of time.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2e4058ce03d3c57f4930c67d1dfafabc0eb39185f500869aaeb7de1dd429a6ef",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s08-p159-01762-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-101",
      "parentFingerprint": "d9f6a2206d89ba91d7d84a1875170770a3d31ebbe57c27013e32c9bae5ede136",
      "passageSha256": "6a8ce7bfa206dc5bce56ac2dde526a2ba5b207137bfd8cb0fe0a08c3f78c3d3b",
      "pdfPages": [
        159
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c14-0001",
      "sentenceId": "c14-opening-p160-b005-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Now that you know the ingredients of a happy life, a meaningful life, and a psychologically rich life, let’s see if you can start seeing the world through a new lens: life in three dimensions.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c0dda4dda15ac2795c39fbbdc928ba9c38f41ae91849056be50d6d909f6c1f29",
      "readingUnitId": "c14-opening-p160-b005-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c14-073",
      "parentFingerprint": "cacde0e1a3716ebc84917c3a341c2d0005fba2b40e4af294ce67316b63c7e22e",
      "passageSha256": "5d9bd143d1bccd60535cd9acb2c295c50ff11b16cb9f62816b498cce4021a75d",
